# Purpose and audience: executable specification for Three-Tier Hybrid Node Storage
# (embedded hot slots + compact inline / CSR attribute arena + host hash sidecar)
# and bitmask-filtered tree node attribute selection across BeDomNode, HNode,
# selector_matcher, and GPU-compatible DomArena.
# @req REQ-SSPEC-UNIT
# @cover src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/browser_engine/dom.spl
# @cover src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/browser_engine/html_tree_builder.spl
# @cover src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/browser_engine/selector_matcher.spl
# @cover src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/browser_engine/simple_web_html_layout_renderer_foundation.spl
# @cover src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/browser_engine/simple_web_html_layout_renderer_core_selectors.spl
# @cover src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/browser_engine/gpu_web/dom/dom_attr_select.spl

